Scope of this licence

* The MIT licence above applies to the source code in src/, tests/ and config/.
* The documents (README.md, docs/, AGENT_CONTEXT.md, CAREER_DECISION_MAP.md,
  DECISION_LOG.md, PUBLICATION_DECISION.md) and the aggregated statistical
  outputs (outputs/tables, outputs/*.json, outputs/figures) are released under
  the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . Please cite as described in
  CITATION.cff.
* The aggregated outputs are statistics derived from job advertisements
  published by third parties (AMS/EURES, karriere.at, LinkedIn, willhaben,
  jobs.at) and from the AMS JobBarometer. No advertisement text, no posting
  identifiers, no employer contact data and no source records are part of this
  public repository; the underlying source material remains private and is not
  licensed here (see PUBLICATION_DECISION.md and
  docs/legal-and-publication-audit.md). Employer names in the employer tables
  are the names of legal entities as they appear in public advertisements.
* No licence is granted for any third-party content, trade mark or database
  right; the licences above do not extend to material owned by the sources.
